{{smaller block|I now fetching a ''windlesse'', that I myght better haue a shoote.{{right|''Lyly'', Euphues and his England, p. 270.}}}}
Hence—'''2.''' Any indirect, artful course; circumvention; art and contrivance; subtleties.
{{smaller block|<poem>Thus do we of wisdom and of reach,
